# TS-029 rig 2 (informal, scratch; 2026-11-04). Scripts: TS-029_rig2_*.sh. Overlays: V0 = amr_description with
# amr.sensors.xacro from be788ca (100 Hz /imu, no plugin); V2 = current xacro minus the ImuDecimator element (1 kHz
# /imu_raw, no plugin); V1 = the installed build (1 kHz + ImuDecimator); V1S = V1 with external subscribers during the
# hold (ros2 topic echo /scan /imu /joint_states; gz topic -e pose/info and /imu_raw), all exiting 5 s before SIGINT.
# Each run: sim.launch.py headless:=true sensors:=true world:=sensor_test.sdf y:=-20.0, both controllers active, hold,
# SIGINT to the launch; if gz sim is alive 3.5 s later: thread snapshot + gdb stack traces (TS-029_V2_run15_*).
